{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D]Fate decreed that we be parted, [G]ere [D]the leaves of autumn fell,[A]
[D]then two hearts were separated [G]that [A]had loved each other well.[D]
[A]She was all I had to [D]cherish, every loving kind and true,[A]
[D]now I see in every [G]vision [A]amber tresses tied in blue.[D]
{end_of_verse}

